enus authored month case-twins for the 6.1 number rules

The twelve month strings the number rules name in the other case
(month_February vs month_february and friends) live in authored data
under their own names. Appends them after the 116-string block with
our offsets (552-631) plus symbols entries. Applies after 0023.

